  "domain": "Telecom",
  "description": "TCCCPR 2018 (amended 2025): consent recorded on the DLT consent register through a verified acquisition, revocable at any time; unsolicited commercial communication complaints verified against preferences and consent, the sender warned / blocked by the graded action rule, complainant informed within the regulatory timeline.",
